OL,3,GNEWSASightings of Asian hornet nests
OL,4,Adouble in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 Asian hornet nests have
OL,7,Fbeen found in Guernsey this season,
OL,8,Fdoubling the number discovered in 2025,
OL,9,Faccording to spotters.
OL,11,FAsian hornets are an invasive species
OL,12,Fand an aggressive predator of many
OL,13,Ftypes of insect, especially honey bees.
OL,15,FDespite the rise in sightings, the
OL,16,FStates of Guernsey said it continued to
OL,17,Ftackle the issue by "actively tracking"
OL,18,Fhornets back to their nests which are
OL,19,Fthen treated with a powder-based
OL,20,Fpesticide.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
