OL,3,GNEWSASightings of Asian hornet nests
OL,4,Adouble in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnelotte Daas-Jehan, invasive
OL,7,Fnon-native species policy and
OL,8,Fco-ordination officer for the States,
OL,9,Fsaid: "I am surprised but not shocked
OL,10,Fbecause we know what's happening in
OL,11,Fother islands and many other European
OL,12,Fcountries."
